#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:7 7d60035819074b859432b4b8b2f3eb1b
msgid "Interface contract"
msgstr "Contrato de interfaz"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:9 63734b5808b24b3b82a0728b9b76b2f5
msgid ""
"Inputs must be explicit, outputs must be inspectable, errors must be "
"returned as errors, and consequential external actions require human "
"approval."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas deben ser explicitas, las salidas inspeccionables, los errores "
"devueltos como errores y las acciones externas importantes requieren "
"aprobacion humana."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:11 45980498da0240e297fa3c2aecde01bd
